Your Majesty,

I commend to Your Majesty the Lady Anne, sister to the Duke of Cleves. The al=
liance would bind us to the Protestant princes and answer the threat of Franc=
e and the Emperor combining against us.

Master Holbein has sent her likeness, which I enclose. All report her gentle =
and of good understanding.

Your servant,
Thomas Cromwell

